# Alterac Mountains - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 7 confirmed in-band rares and the fixed world
# containers of Alterac Mountains. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever); the data records no loot on any of these seven
# rares, so there are no signature drops to chase and no tame lines ship
# either (no loot evidence, no core-guide corroboration — see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so
# none are stated. Jimmy the Bleeder also roams Hillsbrad Foothills, where the
# Hillsbrad companions guide already covers him. Narillasanz (level 44) lives
# above the zone band and is not covered here. No rare in this guide is a
# giver, ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest; the Weathered
# Bookcase is quest-owned and lives in the Hillsbrad core route, not here. See
# docs/alterac-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was
# built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/alterac-rares
title Alterac Mountains - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-40
zone Alterac Mountains
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords alterac, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Stone Fury — the east

  goto 64.68,44.77
  kill 2258 optional
  note Level 37 rare, flagged rare in the data.
  note The data records no loot on this rare at all; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Skhowl — the west

  goto 31.43,51.51
  kill 2452 optional
  note Level 36 rare, flagged rare in the data.
  note The data records no loot on this rare at all; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Lo'Grosh — the center

  loop
  goto 47.52,32.31
  goto 52.09,46.94
  kill 2453 optional
  note Level 39 rare, flagged rare in the data, working the center.
  note The data records no loot on this rare at all; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Gravis Slipknot — east of center

  goto 58.2,41.91
  kill 14221 optional
  note Level 36 rare, flagged rare in the data.
  note The data records no loot on this rare at all; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Araga — the southwest

  goto 30.2,72.11
  kill 14222 optional
  note Level 35 rare, flagged rare in the data.
  note The data records no loot on this rare at all; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Cranky Benj — the north

  goto 37.29,19.83
  kill 14223 optional
  note Level 32 rare, flagged rare in the data.
  note The data records no loot on this rare at all; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Jimmy the Bleeder — the south

  goto 58.58,69.3
  kill 14281 optional
  note Level 23 rare, flagged rare in the data; the same Jimmy roams Hillsbrad Foothills too, where the Hillsbrad companions guide covers him. Below the zone band - take him while passing, if he is up.
  note The data records no loot on this rare at all; respawn timer unconfirmed.

